WEBVTT

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.500
"Starlight."

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:12.000
It's the story of goddesses drawn
by the glow of the heavens.

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:17.910
We can fight and argue and disagree,
but there are ties that bind us together...

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:26.830
Yet we may be pulled from one another,
never to meet again. It is a sad story.

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:33.250
The tale of these eight women captivates us.

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:40.250
The song of these eight women
draws us in and compels us.

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:41.950
Let's go...

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:47.040
To that stage, to that shining star... Together!

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:51.810
Revue Starlight

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:57.400
CHANT

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:05.700
Karen-chan, get up! It's time!
You CANNOT be late today, right?

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:09.660
Day Duty

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:07.750
Karen-chan, come on!

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:12.290
Tomorrow's Another Day,
so Never Mind

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:15.750
Okay.

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:19.370
Jeez!

00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:22.330
You asked me to get you up, so you need to get up!

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:23.700
Okay.

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:26.790
It's not like I'll be on wake-up duty forever, you know!

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:28.830
Yeah. Sorry.

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:30.410
Okay, let's go!

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:33.450
Mahiru-chan, stop!

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:42.800
CHANTRY MA'AM

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:40.120
What?!

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:46.870
Karen-chan!

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.450
I can't believe you came back for that...

00:01:53.870 --> 00:01:56.290
Good morning, Karen-chan.

00:01:58.910 --> 00:02:01.000
Yup. Good morning!

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:07.580
Karen Aijo

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:13.200
Nice! First!

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:31.410
I'm Karen Aijo, Student Number 1 in
Seisho Music Academy's 99th class!

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:31.370
Karen
Aijo

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:31.370
Student
Number 1

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:32.790
Ready to begin!

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:39.540
Stage center, position zero.

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:42.660
Mahiru-chan!

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:43.160
Huh?

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:44.950
Okay, let's stretch.

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:48.200
Yup!

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:51.520
Mahiru
Tsuyuzaki
Student
Number 17

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:52.660
Mahiru Tsuyuzaki, Student Number 17. Ready to begin!

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:56.250
Ow...

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:08.580
Try to focus on your thighs and your butt.

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.620
This is impossible!

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:14.450
Junna
Hoshimi
Student
Number 25

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:14.040
Oh. It's open.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:19.120
Of course! After all, I'm on day duty today!

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:23.200
Aijo-san... Last time, you slept in
and were last to arrive, correct?

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:29.700
To think the day would come when Karen-chan...

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:33.160
Claudine
Saijo
Student
Number 11

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:31.950
could actually get up on time!

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:33.200
That's a big non, non!

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:36.950
Karen Aijo, the Starlet of the Stage,
is evolving day by day!

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:39.120
I'm at my newest right now!

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:41.250
I'm gonna give it more than ever!

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:48.750
Karen-chan, I swear... It's thanks to you
she was able to get up, right, Mahiru-chan?

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:52.120
You're the only one who gets it, Banana-chan!

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:55.910
It's easy enough to get. If you're me, that is.

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:56.080
Nana
Daiba
Student
Number 15

00:03:56.950 --> 00:03:58.870
Come on, wake up already!

00:03:58.870 --> 00:04:00.250
Kaoruko!

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:06.500
How boorish to disturb a young maiden's slumber...

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:09.200
Cut it out with that half-asleep talk!

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:10.080
Kaoruko
Hanayagi
Student
Number 22

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:11.620
Even Karen is awake!

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:14.000
My, what a handful.

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:16.450
Futaba
Isurugi
Student
Number 2

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:21.580
I'd say you're the one with the handful, Futaba-chan.
Having such a sleepyhead for a roommate...

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:24.290
You're one to talk.

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:27.500
Futaba! You can't just let go like that!
C'mon, cut that out!

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:29.290
It's pinch time! Pinch, pinch...

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:29.290
Good morning.

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:30.120
What if I'd gotten really hurt?!

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:35.830
Student Number 18, Maya Tendo. Ready to begin.

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:42.790
Maya
Tendo
Student
Number 18

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:49.790
Student Number 11, Claudine Saijo. Ready to begin.

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:54.450
Student Number 25, Junna Hoshimi. Ready to begin.

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:59.000
Student Number 22, Kaoruko Hanayagi. Ready to begin.

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:03.200
Student Number 2, Futaba Isurugi. Ready to begin!

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:07.750
I'm gonna give it my all today!

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:11.820
Homeroom Teacher, Class 2-A         Urara Sakuragi

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:11.620
Okay, is this everyone?

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:13.290
Yes!

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:18.250
This is all 28 of us from Class 2-A of
the Actor Training Department.

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:21.540
No absences! Everyone, greet our teacher.

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:25.720
May 14
Day Duty:

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:25.720
Karen
Aijo

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.200
Good morning!

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:25.000
Good morning.

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:29.250
This is Seisho Music Academy.

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:33.450
It's a respected girls' school with a 100-year history.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:38.290
It was made to foster the next generation
of theatrical talent!

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:37.590
Actor Training Department

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:42.120
The students of Group A in the
Actor Training Department work daily

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:48.000
to improve their skills in singing, drama, dance,
traditional Japanese dance, and elocution.

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:49.980
Stage Production Department

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:54.620
Group B in the Stage Production Department
studies presentation, scripts, costumes, props...

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:57.540
They work hard to learn
the technical aspects of putting on a play!

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:02.660
We in the academy's 99th class
are in love with the theater,

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:04.540
so it's the life we've chosen to pursue.

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.290
Yes... we're girls of the stage!

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:10.790
We all work together to bring the theater to life...

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:14.540
but we're all rivals to become the next star!

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:26.370
Aah! Banana-chan, your lunch looks delicious!

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:29.290
I've got plenty of it, so...

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:32.040
Man, those lessons wore me out!

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:37.500
Karen-chan, we haven't even
started afternoon classes yet.

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.950
What's our first class again?

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:42.700
Um... English!

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:46.450
English, huh? I think I'll fall asleep.

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:49.540
The Girl Who
Became a Banana

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:52.080
Hoshimi-san!

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:53.580
Here.

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:56.040
Ah! The "Seisho Festival"!

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:58.080
We're about to start prepping for it.

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:01.370
Uh, but that's not till next year.

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:03.580
You can never have enough time.

00:07:03.550 --> 00:07:05.840
Seisho
All members of the 99th Class
Notice of the 100th Seisho Festival Auditions
99th Class 2nd Performance
The Drama "Starlight"

00:07:03.910 --> 00:07:06.000
There's a lot that has to be done.

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:10.830
Yeah, but we're still doing "Starlight," right?
The lines are done and everything.

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:10.800
*Clair     *Flora
8 members

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:15.500
What's most important is that
we do it better than last year!

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:17.200
Oh, yeah.

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:22.660
Still, that sure was fun.
Doing "Starlight" as first-years...

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.080
Yeah!

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:29.290
With Group B backing us up,
Group A got to sing and perform...

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:33.790
We in the 99th class did a production
that was all our own.

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:37.500
It was a single, unforgettable moment
that will last forever.

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:41.120
But it was completely amateurish.

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:44.750
Next year, our performance has to be more polished.

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:48.620
That's why, for our three years here,
we're doing "Starlight."

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:51.870
It's the only show we'll perform.

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:54.370
Yeah...

00:07:54.620 --> 00:08:01.330
She's right. We get to do "Starlight" over again!
Talk about bliss!

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:04.410
You sure do like that story, don't you, Karen-chan?

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:09.500
I mean, it's beautiful but it's sad and passionate and...

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:10.410
What's not to like?!

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:13.580
W-well, I... I do like it.

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:19.290
Right? I sure hope we get named roles again!

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:26.660
M-me too. Maybe next time we... I mean,
you and I, we could even be the fated couple!

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:31.500
Nah, I bet Tendo-san and Claudine-chan
will be the leads again.

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:33.620
Huh? Oh, yeah...

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:37.160
I mean, those two are in a whole
different league from us!

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:41.620
Their singing, their dancing...
the way they shine when they're up on the stage.

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:44.870
There's no way we can compete with 'em...

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:53.160
We haven't even had auditions yet.
Don't assume the lead roles have been decided.

00:08:53.620 --> 00:08:55.120
Uh... Okay.

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:56.660
J..Junna-chan!

00:08:56.870 --> 00:08:58.790
Did I make her angry or something?

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:02.080
When she gets worked up, she's all over the place.

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:07.450
Let's put on the best show we can, okay?
Like when we did "Starlight" before.

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:09.790
Okay!

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:13.410
Karen Aijo, the Starlet of the Stage,
is getting better day by day!

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:17.950
For our next "Starlight," I'm gonna BAM!
show even more wow factor!

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:20.040
Let's all do our best.

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:26.080
You okay, Karen-chan?

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:30.000
I just can't stop... thinking about sandwiches.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.660
It's way too early for you to be throwing in the towel.

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:35.580
Karen-chan? That's the wrong textbook!

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:57.500
Tokyo Tower?!

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:04.750
Wow...

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:08.290
Huh? But, why the great view?

00:10:33.290 --> 00:10:38.080
Oh, yeah. This is where I bought my... my barrette.

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:41.540
And so... it has to come true.

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:44.580
That promise...

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:54.370
K..Karen-chan!

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:56.580
Are you okay, Karen-chan?

00:10:57.330 --> 00:11:00.370
She's fine. The girl's a rock!

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:02.450
You're so heartless, Banana-chan!

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:05.290
Hey, you all right, Karen?

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:07.830
Sure, no problem. Thanks!

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:12.790
Auditions
Day 1

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:18.370
Uh, we have a transfer student who'll be joining us
in the Actor Training Department as of today.

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:22.080
I know it's unexpected but, everyone,
please give her a warm welcome.

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:27.200
That sure was a weird dream...

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:29.580
I'm Hikari Kagura.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.000
Huh?

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:38.160
Hikari
Kagura
May 14
Day Duty:

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:36.250
Hikari-chan...?

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:43.920
Hikari Kagura
Student
Number 29
(Transfer)

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:47.410
May 14
Day Duty:
Karen
Aijo

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:47.410
Hikari
Kagura

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:49.830
Hikari...chan?

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:52.160
Aijo...

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:53.830
Take your seat.

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:55.410
I'm sorry!

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:59.580
Kagura is a transfer student from
the Royal Institute of Dramatic Arts in England.

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:00.450
What?!

00:12:00.450 --> 00:12:03.830
It's been about 12 years since she's been
back in Japan, so show her the ropes, okay?

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:04.830
Yes, Ma'am!

00:12:05.290 --> 00:12:07.660
Let's see, today on day duty is...

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:08.330
Me!

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:09.910
Right here!

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:13.450
I'll help Hikari-chan with everything!

00:12:13.450 --> 00:12:15.160
What? Do you know her?

00:12:15.370 --> 00:12:16.790
Aijo...

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:18.000
I'm sorry!

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:21.750
Oh, it's that girl...

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:25.700
Hikari
Kagura

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:25.750
When homeroom is over,
please show her around the dormitory.

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:27.870
And there's no need to stand up.

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:28.750
Yes, Ma'am!

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:33.040
Tsuyuzaki, go with them.

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:34.660
I worry about her doing it alone.

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:39.000
You're really, truly Hikari-chan, right?!

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.910
It's been a super long time! How many years now?

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:42.870
Twelve.

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:45.040
What?! That long?

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:51.040
You left for England when we were five,
but now you're suddenly back. I was so surprised!

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:54.540
Still, it's pretty incredible...

00:12:54.950 --> 00:13:00.120
The Royal Institute is the hardest school
in the world to get into, right?

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:02.040
Huh? Is that true?

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:05.120
You don't know about it? That place is my dream!

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:09.700
You sure are amazing, Hikari-chan!

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:11.450
Not especially...

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:16.370
And yet, you haven't changed it at all!

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:21.910
You've worn it this whole time!
You know, the thing we promised on.

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:28.330
That's right.

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:33.870
Yay! We're here!

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:37.830
Karen-chan, this is our room, you know.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:41.250
Yup! As of today, it'll be the three of us.

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:47.370
Mahiru-chan?

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:50.790
Hold on, Karen-chan! This is way too sudden!

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:53.540
But she'd be lonely all by herself, right?

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:55.870
I don't want three people living here.

00:13:56.330 --> 00:13:58.120
I mean... I can't do it!

00:13:58.750 --> 00:13:59.620
Huh?

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:05.200
Hikari-chan?

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:07.700
I'd just get in the way, wouldn't I?

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:10.450
I wouldn't say that but, um...

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:12.500
Hikari-chan!

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:20.040
Hikari-cha...

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:22.040
Sorry. I have to get ready now.

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:25.370
Hikari-chan...

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:29.080
I'm glad you're back

00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:32.330
From here on out, let's do our best...

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:35.250
and both become stars!

00:14:36.160 --> 00:14:38.000
Like we promised.

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:42.330
Karen...

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:19.830
Wow, Hikari-chan was so good!

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:24.330
That jump was amazing!
Oh man, she was like a grasshopper!

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:27.450
Her grand fouette was quite lovely, too.

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:30.750
Your old friend is pretty good, Karen!

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:31.700
Isn't she?

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:35.830
And yet, she does seem to be
giving us the cold shoulder...

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:39.450
That just makes her cool and mysterious!

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:41.500
Huh? What does that even mean?!

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:47.000
Hikari Kagura...

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:55.000
Wow... So, they're perfoming it again?

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:58.080
Apparently, the villain from last time
will be playing the lead.

00:15:58.450 --> 00:15:59.830
Huh?

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:00.500
What?

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:02.410
Karen-chan?

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:05.450
Banana, do you know where Hikari-chan is?

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:09.000
Oh, okay. Thanks!

00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:14.330
Hikari Kagura, huh?

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:16.500
It's like a rival has appeared, right?

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:21.870
And yet, it's as if... her heart just isn't in it.

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:23.750
Huh?

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:32.040
Hikari-chan? Hikari-chan?

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:36.830
Hikari-chan!

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:42.790
Oh, look at this.

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:57.160
Hikari...chan?

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:06.200
Sorry! I forgot something in there!

00:17:11.620 --> 00:17:12.700
Hikari-chan?

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:19.330
An elevator?

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:22.580
Has this always been here?

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:27.080
Huh?

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:39.560
Underground
Theater
Seisho Music
Academy

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:40.700
Now, we shall begin day one

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:43.070
Underground Theater Center Stage

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:44.250
of auditions for this passionate revue!

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:44.580
AKA                   Position Zero

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:51.000
Let us compete in song and dance,
and aim to become the top star.

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:14.000
Yami o sakitomotta gekikou ga shoujotachi no katsubou o terasu

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:17.000
Hoshimi-san?

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:19.290
And Hikari-chan?!

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:22.450
This is... "Starlight"!

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:26.910
But, what are they doing?

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:35.660
Stop it, Hoshimi-san!

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:38.290
They understand.

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:43.620
A giraffe?!

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:48.580
The "Revue"... has already begun.

00:18:48.950 --> 00:18:50.660
This is the Revue?

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:57.000
Ten made todoku honoo watashi o yakitsukusu no

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:55.870
Yes. Song and dance woven into
a mesmerizing stage show.

00:18:56.120 --> 00:19:00.040
The one who presents us
with the most dazzling of revues...

00:18:57.410 --> 00:19:05.040
Tobira ni hikareta hoshi ga ochitekuru toki

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:08.290
Until the World
is Turned to Ash

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:05.040
shall find the path to top stardom opened before her.

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:08.290
A Revue of Passion

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:14.250
Yuzurenai yume ga aru mamoritai sora ga aru

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:14.500
Who will obtain that heavenly tiara
and become the Top Star, I wonder...

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:22.750
Ryuusei o katadotta ya ga oikaketeiku wa

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:18.000
Who would agree to that?!

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:19.540
Yes, I know.

00:19:19.540 --> 00:19:21.870
And yet... they are desperate, aren't they?

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:25.160
After all, they are "Stage Girls."

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:31.250
Tooku chisakunaru itsuka kieteshimau omoide

00:19:25.160 --> 00:19:25.790
Huh?

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:34.910
Everyday happiness, the pleasures of a young girl,
all burned away in pursuit of that faraway brilliance...

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:39.950
Mukai kaze ni hidoku aorare hisokani tateta chikai

00:19:34.910 --> 00:19:37.120
That is a "Stage Girl"!

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:40.370
Do you have that determination?

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:48.040
Kitto jama sasenai kono sekai o hi ni suru made

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:46.330
That jacket...

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:49.500
If it falls, the revue is over.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:58.700
Dare yori atsuku moetsuzukeru watashi no jounetsu wa

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:52.500
Hikari-chan!

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:56.540
You cannot stop them.

00:19:56.870 --> 00:19:59.370
Those who can't wake up on their own in the morning...

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:02.160
Those content not playing the lead...

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:05.120
Such people will not be called upon.

00:20:06.790 --> 00:20:09.330
Now then, I must ask you to leave.

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:11.790
Hm?

00:20:13.370 --> 00:20:15.200
Giraffe! Outta my way!

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:20.040
I made a promise to Hikari-chan!

00:20:20.790 --> 00:20:23.370
I... No, we...

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:27.250
We will become stars, together!

00:20:27.560 --> 00:20:33.850
I AM                                                                                                      REMADE

00:20:34.610 --> 00:20:35.620
No. 99 Trolley Furnace
Fuel to the Fire

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:36.620
No. 99 Trolley Furnace
Fuel to the Fire

00:20:46.630 --> 00:20:47.630
Sewing Process

00:21:12.610 --> 00:21:14.370
Please do not touch

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:16.790
Atop a stage brimming with stardust,

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:20.830
I am reborn, and clad in the flowers
of love that have so magnificently bloomed...

00:21:20.830 --> 00:21:23.410
and I will leap onto that stage of light
to make my appearance!

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:24.790
Student of the 99th class...

00:21:25.080 --> 00:21:26.290
Karen Aijo!

00:21:28.830 --> 00:21:31.750
We will all do Starlight!

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:39.410
Don't get in the way!

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:46.200
Yuzurenai yume nara watashi ni mo kitto aru shinjiteru

00:21:41.200 --> 00:21:42.000
No...

00:21:43.950 --> 00:21:45.200
No, Karen!

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:58.200
Takanaru kono mune no oku fukaku
tomotta no shizuka ni jounetsu ga ima

00:22:02.870 --> 00:22:04.200
Position Zero!

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:12.250
This concludes the first day of auditions.

00:22:20.950 --> 00:22:22.000
Hikari-chan!

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:28.540
Stupid...

00:22:29.950 --> 00:22:30.870
Stupid Karen!

00:22:37.500 --> 00:22:42.290
Revue Starlight

00:24:00.860 --> 00:24:05.870
Next time
The Stage of Fate

00:24:01.750 --> 00:24:03.830
Revue Starlight!

00:24:03.830 --> 00:24:05.660
I know.
